menu "Oral-B battery monitor"

    config APP_BRUSH_ADDR
        string "Brush BLE address filter"
        default ""
        help
            Optional "aa:bb:cc:dd:ee:ff". Leave empty to pair with the first
            device that advertises a valid Oral-B iO payload.

    menu "polling"

        config APP_POLL_CHARGING_MINUTES
            int "Poll interval while the brush is charging (minutes)"
            range 1 720
            default 10
            help
                Docked is the safest moment to take the brush's single BLE
                slot. Battery changes slowly, so this is deliberately not
                aggressive.

        config APP_POLL_IDLE_MINUTES
            int "Poll interval while the brush is idle and off the charger (minutes)"
            range 1 1440
            default 60
            help
                The brush sleeps (state 115) when off the charger and only
                advertises periodically, so a long interval costs nothing.

    endmenu

endmenu
